        "name": "Bowie",
        "username": "Bowie",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bowie/{size}/2097_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-08-16T16:30:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"schadkehnfreude\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/schadkehnfreude/48/2357_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> schadkehnfreude:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>we had a cool Legacy-Expatriette combo going in our game and I'm kinda flummoxed at how teams won't get overrun without it.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Never been so happy with Hairtrigger Reflexes. What was it, six or seven damage every time someone popped up out of the doorway while Legacy was there? So beautiful.</p>",
