        "id": 165075,
        "name": "varia.knight",
        "username": "varia.knight",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/v/ea666f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-08-25T12:26:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"schadkehnfreude\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/schadkehnfreude/48/2357_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> schadkehnfreude:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Oh my!Belatedly, I got a few pictures and a vid from the costume contest, though not with me at the moment - I mostly remember Fanatic, Super Sci Tachyon, Unity and flipped LeCap, though they were all fantastic - especially the one GTG staffer who cosplayed as Christopher.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Would you be willing to post those pictures when you get a chance?&nbsp; I was one of the Matriarchs at the costume contest, and I've been lurking for awhile, hoping to see pictures.</p>",
